error[E0277]: the trait bound `&str: Zeroize` is not satisfied
  --> tests/ui/owned_collection_elements.rs:13:13
   |
13 |     let _ = EncryptInto::encrypt_into::<Vec<Ciphertext>, _>(vec!["borrowed", "plaintext"], keyset);
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the trait `zeroize::DefaultIsZeroes` is not implemented for `&str`
   |
   = help: the following other types implement trait `zeroize::DefaultIsZeroes`:
             ()
             PhantomPinned
             bool
             char
             f32
             f64
             i128
             i16
           and $N others
   = note: required for `&str` to implement `Zeroize`
   = note: required for `Vec<stack_encrypt::Ciphertext>` to implement `EncryptTarget<Vec<&str>>`

